# Wrong output (PLAN.md): the thread count tries every active lane as
# the elected one, but the threads and the sectors read the lowest: the
# store under `%tid.x == 1 and elected` runs `<= 1` time per CTA, but
# its threads read `no thread` and its sectors none, where lane 1, if
# elected, requests one.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/micro/elect_lane.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
ANN: {{^}}	@%p3 st.global.b32 	[%rd2], %r1; // no thread | exec <= 1/CTA | global store [param_0] sectors/req 0 (ideal 0){{$}}
